<description>&lt;p&gt;Armed men ambushed a market convoy in western Niger, killing at least 37 civilians. In northern Burkina Faso, rival jihadist groups JNIM and ISSP intensified clashes, while Ukrainian officers are training Sahel militants on drone use. In northern Nigeria, opposition leader Atiku accused President Tinubu of failing Nigerians after 638 people were killed and 64,000 fled into Niger. The war produced 4,159 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxNR0tsQzdQdS1zem1xMkJFeUZqR3FsV3draGV2aWdOTVVOMlZGOWdOb3M4Mk9RT3NPcjhlekJ1Zk10cWlqbjU0TGJXaUVwdHhDTmdBalZ5WEFNNktmRjdxajB1bnhWVm5UWmo4c2JCWGw4VzQxY1pxLUFZSF9Oamd2R2NnczlRd3BFWEJna2hmUHdxdmhjNkNMOA?oc=5&quot;&gt;theopenpress.in&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxOeWNTZ1pFc2Q4ZXFLY0hhN3RsWVpUZkhuUjl0aDFRbHBUczE2ckZuelppOTNjYXNHVWN5clFwemxfOFptbXE2X05MSlNtenFSNGluUW9fQ2dkbzlfRXpxRExTX0RwZjh2UE95cXBUUVpGVkJOWG00ZFExaTdXblBLaVZmV2RLUzljRDhQRU16OA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Truth Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMibkFVX3lxTE9DdVVrZWxzbFV3Tnk3MmVwYml3Nmp3aERTN2FzQlh2a2pHMEF4TEtyQVY2OExnVU5zNDZVSlRucWpmVW83UGw2YkR0Y0lZWTZXTFBycTBWVW5LZVFuTXYyOEpxQnlfWE0xREJTMG9n?oc=5&quot;&gt;news.sbs.co.kr&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New Indian Express&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxOT1VHLWxMbENQekJxbG9BOXdqcHlaSnFDLU5mV2NRN0J1LS1MYWR0YksxcEx1eEN6M2s3dDBQUGV6Mmo1bl9XQ0lsZDk2SjlaM2d2MDdWMU15R2JjOThQbE80NXhrZXEzY3FIWlNQb1VkaHh1LWdNa2hwQ3pNSVVCSWFlM011QzkxbjJmYVg5eG8xOVRhSzJ3N1k3V1cxRUZH?oc=5&quot;&gt;New Age BD&lt;